Z||000006||rockcrawl||05-26-2001||10:31 PM||||There is an RPO code for each spring, codes start with 6,7,8, and 9. Cars with WS6 use different set of spring options. Take a look at this for a better explanation. <A HREF="http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Garage/5007/fiero_osg/springs.html" TARGET=_blank>http://www.geocities.com/MotorCity/Garage/5007/fiero_osg/springs.html</A>  There are a lot more spring options than most people think, and I have seen ones that are not even on that list. The front swaybar was the same for all fieros except for the '88. 1984-87 SHAFT, front stabilizer (23 mm) p/n 10023227. ||||reg||1
